    "desc": "# CARD UNFINISHED BEFORE RELEASE\n\n#\nLore:\n\n## “The Hustle! Time to do your stuff!”\n\n**Paco Laburante’s Stand has no body of its own. It lives in his muscles and gives him total control over them, so he can swell them to crush a throat, harden them to shrug off a blow or crawl up a wall with them.**\n\n---\n\n![image.webp](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ae906558dde2ede23744046/attachments/6af06bc63a55622a8f9dd46c/previews/6af06bc63a55622a8f9dd481/download/image.webp)\n\n---\n\n## Chiseled Like A Rock\n\n**Summoning The Hustle grows muscles on your body. While it’s out you take 10% less damage, deal 5% more melee damage and deal 50% more damage to piloted Stands. Use R while blocking to knock bullets away.**\n\n![the\\_hustle.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ae906558dde2ede23744046/attachments/6af06cd20a0420c0f5fe14ff/previews/6af06cd30a0420c0f5fe158d/download/the_hustle.gif)",
